# SmartDoc AI Suite

SmartDoc AI is an intelligent document analysis platform
built using Python, LangChain and Groq AI.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- LangChain
- Groq AI (LLaMA3)
- Streamlit
- PromptTemplate
- LangChain Chains

## Module 4 - Code Review Assistant

Code Review Assistant is a simple web application built
using Python, LangChain and Groq AI. This project helps
users review their code automatically where the AI
detects bugs, security issues and suggests improvements
using Artificial Intelligence.

## Features
- AI-powered Code Review
- Multiple Language Support
- Bug Detection and Fixes
- Security Issue Detection
- Performance Improvements
- Best Practice Suggestions
- Fast Response using Groq AI
- Beginner-friendly Structure

## Project Modules

### Module 4 - Code Review Assistant
- Select programming language
- Select review type
- Paste your code
- AI reviews and suggests fixes

## Installation
pip install -r requirements.txt

## Run
cd module4_codereview
streamlit run streamlit_app.py
